    prov:wasAttributedTo <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/agent/delphisci-resolvability-assessor-grok-4.7-high-fast> .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/wolfram2002-ch12-42> delphi:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/wolfram2002-ch12-42--grok--operationalizability> .
